/android/app/release

# Committed on purpose, unlike a library's lock: a patch must compile against
# the exact dependency versions the host was built with. A runner that
# re-resolves them drifts (archive 4.6.0 -> 4.7.0, for one) and `patch` then
# fails with PATCH_PINNED_PACKAGE_CHANGED.

# This demo's settings, baselines and updates belong to each developer who
# runs it. In your own app, commit flutter_patcher.yaml: it holds public keys.
/flutter_patcher_keys/
/flutter_patcher.yaml
/.flutter_patcher/
